     - `payments.stripe.enabled` - Master switch for Stripe payment processing
     - `checkout.order-creation.enabled` - Controls cart-to-order conversion
     - `media.uploads.enabled` - Controls all media upload operations
     - `media.processing.enabled` - Controls image resize/derivative generation
     - `admin.impersonation.enabled` - Platform admin impersonation capability
   - Each kill switch includes owner, description, and rollback impact details
   - Added service-level kill switch helper usage examples

### 2. **FeatureToggle Service Enhancements**
   - **File**: `modules/core-platform/src/main/java/villagecompute/storefront/services/FeatureToggle.java`
   - **Added 5 emergency kill switch helper methods**:
     - `isPaymentsEnabled()` - Check payment processing status
     - `isCheckoutEnabled()` - Check checkout/order creation status
     - `isMediaUploadEnabled()` - Check media upload status
     - `isMediaProcessingEnabled()` - Check media processing status
     - `isImpersonationEnabled()` - Check impersonation status
   - All helpers leverage existing cache infrastructure and tenant context
   - Properly documented with references to architecture and governance docs

### 3. **Comprehensive Test Coverage**
   - **File**: `modules/core-platform/src/test/java/villagecompute/storefront/services/FeatureToggleTest.java`
   - **Added 16 new test cases**:
     - **Cache Precedence Tests** (5 tests):
       - Tenant override disables global default
       - Tenant override enables when global missing
       - Multiple tenants with independent overrides
       - Invalidation affects single tenant only
     - **Emergency Kill Switch Tests** (11 tests):
